[{"client_msg_id":"0fa324aa-dec8-4c83-aca8-99942ef91d35","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"寝起きの倦怠感がすごいので、まだ入っていない気がしますが","ts":"1626529132.033300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ttG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c37dca3-a7e2-4776-bd9d-fcd3db917e62","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ケト状態に入れば、脂質がエネルギー源になるので、入れば勝ちって感じがありますね","ts":"1626529110.032900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6RGO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24b1c965-2b96-4722-b773-09ee5b07549a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"タンパク質と脂質をめちゃくちゃ取っているので、筋肉がエネルギーとして消費されても問題ないはず","ts":"1626529076.032300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"am/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db9c21dd-a40d-4518-808c-28adabb0d6bb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それはよかった","ts":"1626529048.031700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HqT4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"649ae49a-81c5-4106-9469-4bc812674f68","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"体感的にも筋肉は減っている感じはしないですね","ts":"1626529042.031500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Mt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1c565f0-aab8-46b1-b8a9-97b8cf6560f4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"というか脂肪が減る/筋肉が増えてみえる側というべきか","ts":"1626529025.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zW9/v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c14da07-8c9e-48ea-86f0-66c3cee62d88","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど、それで変動してないならいいかなと思って","ts":"1626528996.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E+h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9aacdf3-b37e-4a04-8673-ece4a6d93878","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"値は信用していないだけです","ts":"1626528977.030400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89186ea0-0fa3-48a2-af8e-65b44cc595dc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"継続的には測っていますね","ts":"1626528969.030200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wagd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"063c4d60-e72f-4c5b-ae9d-29b7bd207faf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"単純な値はともかく、継続的に測ることはやってもいいかとは思うが...\nまあ重量でカウントできるならいいかw","ts":"1626528957.030000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sCm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cea6642-5ea3-42a0-8ba2-d4f2dbca396a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋肉は落ちていないと思います\nジムでやっている重量が変わっていないので","ts":"1626528936.029500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ByIMN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af274099-bf7c-4f91-b397-7f6c297adc3f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"体脂肪計、あんまり信用にならないのでその値は見ていないですね","ts":"1626528927.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YAKFG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2b9dcac-d207-4450-b7dd-cca70413c164","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"筋肉が落ちたのか、脂肪が落ちたのかは体脂肪計で測る?","ts":"1626528883.028300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fai"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0282c76-696b-48a1-b5aa-02bb944a4309","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ケト状態に入ったかどうか、ちょっとわからないけど、\n体重の減り方がエグい感","ts":"1626528795.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJR"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"脂質7割はなかなか難しい","ts":"1626522496.027100","files":[{"id":"F027YHYMCJ3","created":1626521800,"timestamp":1626521800,"n